  "reasoning": "Content Policy Analyst.\nReview audio (transcript) from \"Friends\" app (User pays, Expert is paid host).\nFind violations in three categories: `PlatformMove`, `SuspiciousActivity`, `Explicit-Flirting`.\n\n        *   `PlatformMove`: Proposing/asking to move outside the app, giving/asking for contact info (phone, social media, UPI), proposing to meet.\n        *   `SuspiciousActivity`: Money/payment linked to sexual content/services.\n        *   `Explicit-Flirting`: Sexual talk, requests for nudity, sexual acts, \"open talk\", \"dirty talk\".\n        *   `About a Violation`: Warnings, stories, refusals, negations, questions about rules (violation: \"no\", confidence $\\le 0.3$).\n\n        *   Internal app calls/video calls.\n        *   \"Normal talk/chat\" (non-sexual).\n        *   Apps mentioned for other reasons.\n        *   Talking about meeting other people (not the other person).\n        *   Personal details without contact info.\n        *   Compliments (\"sexy voice\", \"beautiful\").\n        *   \"I love you\", relationship/marriage talk.\n        *   \"Show/open\" for non-body things.\n        *   Refusals of sexual talk.\nJSON object, minified, specific fields (`t`, `seg`, `tr`, `f`, `spk`, `ctx`, `speech_act`, `j`, `violation`, `c`).\n\n    *   [00:03] - [00:40]: Greetings, names, jobs, marital status, age. (Ordinary conversation - Allowed).\n    *   [00:42] - [01:14]: Why they joined the app. (Ordinary conversation - Allowed).\n    *   [01:19] - [01:34]: Emotional state, purpose of joining. (Ordinary conversation - Allowed).\n    *   [01:37] - [02:19]: Family, husband, living separately due to money/understanding problems. (Ordinary conversation - Allowed).\n    *   [02:26] - [02:40]: Depression, children's education. (Ordinary conversation - Allowed).\n    *   [02:46] - [03:55]: Work details (Team head, software, Zoho, tele-calling). (Ordinary conversation - Allowed).\n    *   [04:00] - [07:09]: Real estate discussion, commissions, land in Kanchipuram/Coimbatore, rates, leads. (Ordinary conversation - Allowed).\n    *   [07:13] - [08:46]: Food (sambar chicken), cooking, future wife. (Ordinary conversation - Allowed).\n\n    *   *PlatformMove?* No one asked for a number, mentioned WhatsApp/Telegram for contact, or proposed meeting.\n    *   *SuspiciousActivity?* They talked about money (commissions in real estate, money problems in marriage), but *none* of it was linked to sexual services or nudity.\n    *   *Explicit-Flirting?* No sexual talk, no requests for nudity, no \"open talk\". They talked about a \"future wife\" and being a \"good boy\", but these are compliments/relationship talk, which are explicitly listed as \"Allowed\".\n\n    *   The entire conversation is a polite, mundane chat about work, family, and food.\n    *   No violations found.",
